.TH TS-PROXY 1 "September 2026" "Qore" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ts-proxy \- JavaScript worker for Qore process pools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ts-proxy
.BI --socket= path
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the JavaScript worker protocol over the specified Unix socket.
Normally started by TypeScriptActionInterface process pools.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -s , " --socket=" path
Parent Unix socket path.
.TP
.BR -l , " --logdir=" directory
Log directory.
.TP
.BR -v , " --verbose"
Increase logging verbosity.
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Display usage.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
TS_PROXY_PROCESS_KEY supplies the parent worker authentication key.
